{
  "name": "Email Auto-Label",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Add AI labels to Gmail messages\nWith this workflow you can automatically set labels for your Gmail message according to its content. \n\nIn this workflow available are 3 labels: \"Jobs\", \"Security\" and \"Subscriptions\". Feel free to adjust labels according to your needs. \n\n**Please remember to set label names both in your Gmail account and workflow.**",
        "height": 240.57943708322733,
        "width": 420.4803040774015,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b824ef83-5f78-4f63-a518-2f92c144cab6",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -464,
        -80
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "###\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n### JSON schema\nEdit JSON schema and label names according to your needs.\n\n⚠️ **Label names in system prompt and JSON schema should be the same.**",
        "height": 527,
        "width": 242
      },
      "id": "21770e86-d0f6-4f26-b0fa-9a44597f4c63",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        832,
        368
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Merge labels\nCombine labels retrieved from Gmail account and assigned by AI together.",
        "height": 347.0476323933831,
        "width": 226.14233872620645
      },
      "id": "c5b63be5-0bf9-4d43-ad23-bef2b984ece5",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1568,
        16
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Aggregarte labels and add to message\nCreate array of label IDs and add to the desired email message in Gmail.",
        "height": 347.0476323933831,
        "width": 452.48413953150185
      },
      "id": "ee62552b-167b-4fcd-911a-ececf89240b8",
      "name": "Sticky Note6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1824,
        16
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Get message content\nBased on Gmail message ID retrieve body content of the email and pass it to AI chain.\n\nWe're only limiting this to 1 message due to API tokens limitations.",
        "height": 348.5873725349161,
        "width": 238.4602598584674
      },
      "id": "8248b08a-cf2a-4992-97dd-be53c4b26bee",
      "name": "Sticky Note7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        368,
        -16
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Assign labels\nLet the AI decide which labels suit the best content of the message.\n\n⚠️ **Remember to edit system prompt** - modify label names and instructions according to your needs.",
        "height": 348.5873725349161,
        "width": 378.57661273793565
      },
      "id": "372174d8-28d4-4b79-b26b-05caf48aab03",
      "name": "Sticky Note8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        624,
        -16
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $('Get many messages').item.json.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You assign labels to emails based on their content. The labels are:\n\nJobs\nSecurity\nSubscriptions\n\nEach email must have a label. If an email doesn't seem to accurately match with one of the labels, use the closest one. Return only label names in JSON format, nothing else. Do not make things up."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d5b624f0-8079-4d1d-840b-9041fdfcbda6",
      "name": "Assign labels for message",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        688,
        176
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1.5
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"labels\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"enum\": [\"Jobs\", \"Security\", \"Subscriptions\"]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"labels\"]\n}"
      },
      "id": "615765a5-68c8-4854-b385-82c1d625ffa9",
      "name": "JSON Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "position": [
        912,
        384
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "72d11a72-6693-447c-b7ca-4ba1a3579075",
              "name": "labels",
              "type": "array",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.labels }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "33a10a02-619a-480a-93fe-92a164a368f9",
      "name": "Set label values",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1072,
        176
      ],
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
